# Qubitars Tech - Project Structure Documentation

## Overview
This is a Next.js 15 project with TypeScript, featuring authentication, dashboard functionality, and a modern UI built with Tailwind CSS v4. The project uses React 19, GSAP for animations, and various icon libraries for a professional digital agency website.

## Root Directory Structure

```
D:\Qubitars Tech\
├── 📁 node_modules\           # Dependencies (auto-generated)
├── 📁 public\                 # Static assets
├── 📁 src\                    # Source code
├── 📄 package.json            # Project dependencies and scripts
├── 📄 pnpm-lock.yaml          # Package lock file
├── 📄 next.config.ts          # Next.js configuration
├── 📄 tailwind.config.js      # Tailwind CSS configuration
├── 📄 tsconfig.json           # TypeScript configuration
├── 📄 eslint.config.mjs       # ESLint configuration
├── 📄 postcss.config.mjs      # PostCSS configuration
├── 📄 next-env.d.ts           # Next.js TypeScript declarations
└── 📄 README.md               # Project documentation
```

## Public Directory (`/public`)
Contains static assets served directly by Next.js:

